Creditable Discovery plugin

You may install and use this plugin to connect to Creditable Discovery. The public terms of use for the service are available at https://creditable.vc/agents#discovery-terms.

Use Creditable Discovery to research public funding routes and builder resources. Check each provider’s current terms before relying on a listing. A listing or introduction does not guarantee eligibility, investment, employment, or a response. Using Discovery creates no equity agreement. Do not send confidential materials or personal contact details through Discovery. Questions about these terms can go to jack@creditable.vc.
